  "description": "Sang-Hun and Seo-Yun have been together since childhood. What began as friendship blossomed into love, and the two became a couple after graduation. However, unlike Seo-Yun, who, now that they’re a couple, wants to be closer than ever, Sang-Hun strangely avoids physical contact...\n\nSeo-Yun feels hurt that Sang-Hun seems reluctant to deepen their relationship. One day, his pent-up frustration finally reaches a breaking point. Sang-Hun finally reveals the secret he had been hiding, even from Seo-Yun. But Seo-Yun’s reaction to Sang-Hun’s secret seems suspicious…?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
